# Environment variables

Copy to `.env` for local development. In the sandbox, secrets are delivered by
the platform to `/run/base44/app.env` and must not be committed.

## Backend (`backend/`)

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `DATABASE_URL` | yes | PostgreSQL connection string. Set by compose for local runs. |
| `PORT` | no | API port, default `4000`. |
| `JWT_SECRET` | **yes** | Signs owner/admin session cookies. Generate a long random value. |
| `PLATFORM_ADMIN_EMAIL` | no | Seed only. Default `admin@gift.local`. |
| `PLATFORM_ADMIN_PASSWORD` | no | Seed only. Default `admin12345`. |
| `DEMO_OWNER_EMAIL` | no | Seed only. Default `owner@demo.local`. |
| `DEMO_OWNER_PASSWORD` | no | Seed only. Default `demo12345`. |
| `DEMO_STORE_SLUG` | no | Seed only. Default `jewellers-demo`. |
| `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID` | no | Enables live subscription checkout. |
| `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET` | no | Razorpay API secret. Server-side only. |
| `RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | no | Verifies webhook signatures. |
| `RAZORPAY_PLAN_STARTER` | no | Razorpay plan id for the Starter plan. |
| `RAZORPAY_PLAN_GROWTH` | no | Razorpay plan id for the Growth plan. |
| `RAZORPAY_PLAN_MULTI_STORE` | no | Razorpay plan id for the Multi-store plan. |

The app boots without the Razorpay variables. Subscription checkout then
returns a clear "payments are not configured" response instead of pretending to
charge anyone.

## Frontend

| Variable | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET` | no | Dev-server proxy target for `/api`. Compose sets `http://api:4000`. |
| `VITE_GOOGLE_REVIEW_URL` | no | Optional global default Google review link. |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` | no | Only if you switch to the Supabase data provider. |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | no | Only if you switch to the Supabase data provider. |

Never place secret keys in frontend variables — anything prefixed `VITE_` is
shipped to the browser.
